  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "來去宜蘭羅東之路 ——詩三首（二）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>黃明勝</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">傳藝中心</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">傳藝中心順人意</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">河洛坊lóng古早味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">綠色樹林青lìng-lìng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心情快活笑hi-hi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">咖啡店內看四邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鳥隻輕鬆唸歌詩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">觀光遊客若來去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歡喜笑聲滿港墘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天送碑</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">羅東西南十外里</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">四大張票真稀奇</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">五分仔車tsiânn siàu念</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是古蹟ê保護區</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿娘對阮輕輕講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">祈福亭跤beh hip相</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">保庇平安koh健康</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">萬事大吉lóng成功</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">安農溪</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">安農溪冬山鄉村</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溪水phú色天無雲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">涼風tsūn-tsūn吹胸前</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風景盡展自然味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心情輕鬆笑hi-hi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">分洪堰頂看四邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一路辛苦行到tann</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山龍祝阮平安行</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgaGWcs7Vn3AJ9BtooPkxGDOMvugQfc4chCTEjYnvnUJ6ja2dZnJw6R1mdZMjSUsiZlIlzfZxkvO-O0RbJN30TPIuylYhQ-12FD8TDAEvpZ1__dRw64rcR6C1Wub2Mm1ni2hgccoJikOCKOa_JEoFLNnS__ynDAfPh3l2njnba58ZDOXaNk3AVko7Fdjqd/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1365%E6%9C%9F_03B.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgaGWcs7Vn3AJ9BtooPkxGDOMvugQfc4chCTEjYnvnUJ6ja2dZnJw6R1mdZMjSUsiZlIlzfZxkvO-O0RbJN30TPIuylYhQ-12FD8TDAEvpZ1__dRw64rcR6C1Wub2Mm1ni2hgccoJikOCKOa_JEoFLNnS__ynDAfPh3l2njnba58ZDOXaNk3AVko7Fdjqd/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1365%E6%9C%9F_03B.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJ8lwM33SNNOVylS2_I3hKn8GrnvT0G_G7An0qhCD2qiEbTJKSNJbwwb9X-LmTQ8MP_7YW4aZbD9_0L76x6r7mzFMYqlj1diBMNhDDOZTTGa6z7rvZFUKCi7ltpND2uSfmwj2saXB2WD40WtH5WmnJDtAol6RszxQgJ1shmrQqujksxRzd42UFnwCx-Gq8/s1424/365%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJ8lwM33SNNOVylS2_I3hKn8GrnvT0G_G7An0qhCD2qiEbTJKSNJbwwb9X-LmTQ8MP_7YW4aZbD9_0L76x6r7mzFMYqlj1diBMNhDDOZTTGa6z7rvZFUKCi7ltpND2uSfmwj2saXB2WD40WtH5WmnJDtAol6RszxQgJ1shmrQqujksxRzd42UFnwCx-Gq8/w450-h640/365%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%8